The country flags in this folder (one SVG per ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 code) are copied unchanged from flag-icons,
https://github.com/lipis/flag-icons (flags/4x3), under the MIT license below. The lordos.org Languages page
(/language/) shows one on each language card, as decoration; the build publishes this notice at
/licenses/flag-icons-MIT.txt.

